The visual mesh roqsim_sensors/models/d415/meshes/d415.obj is converted (STL -> OBJ, decimated to
~12.7k triangles for real-time rendering, shipped in metres) from d415.stl in:

    https://github.com/IntelRealSense/realsense-ros
    (realsense2_description/meshes/d415.stl)

